# Research Configuration

No runnable configuration has been added.

Future configurations should record the strategy, hypothesis version, data version, split, execution rules, costs, risk limits, random seed, and output folder. Keep strategy-specific settings under strategies/.

Set the dataset root explicitly through local settings or a declared data source. Avoid hard-coded private paths. A container cannot be assumed to read the sibling data directory.

Keep credentials out of tracked files. When needed, document variable names with placeholder values in .env.example.
